":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붉은빛을","audio":"/audio/efc37d474b8809b1e3e2.mp3"}},{"text":"띤","meaning":"呈现、泛着（某种色调）","explanation":"빛을 띠다：带有或呈现某种颜色、光泽。띤 是 띠다 的修饰形式，不是后缀。","readings":[{"term":"띠다","audio":"/audio/7656bfae0d145ceb6a40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52762","senseId":"4","lemma":"띠다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"띤","audio":"/audio/ed8f33258bd3949e3b99.mp3"}},{"text":"장미를","meaning":"玫瑰，蔷薇","explanation":"장미：玫瑰，蔷薇；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장미","audio":"/audio/5b91cb2b3aa9deb81cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31498","senseId":"1","lemma":"장미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장미를","audio":"/audio/36a8ab8326af3443dc7e.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아해요.","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아해요","audio":"/audio/5f9319d9c169323b3fe4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5b91cb2b3aa9deb8","term":"장미","zh":"玫瑰，蔷薇","audio":"/audio/5b91cb2b3aa9deb81cb0.mp3","entryId":"31498","definition":"茎上有刺，五月或六月开有香气的红色、白色、黄色花朵。","pronunciation":["장미"]},{"id":"56aef31d9ebf1888","term":"특히","zh":"特别，尤其，尤为","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3","entryId":"71300","definition":"与众不同地。","pronunciation":["트키"]},{"id":"b85946cfacf334e3","term":"붉다","zh":"红，赤","audio":"/audio/b85946cfacf334e3f2a1.mp3","entryId":"71058","definition":"颜色像鲜血或熟了的辣椒一样。","pronunciation":["북따"]},{"id":"bcfe8128a79515ee","term":"빛","zh":"光，色","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3","entryId":"62079","definition":"物体显现出来的颜色。","pronunciation":["빋"]},{"id":"7656bfae0d145ceb","term":"띠다","zh":"呈现、泛着（某种色调）","audio":"/audio/7656bfae0d145ceb6a40.mp3","entryId":"52762","definition":"呈现、泛着（某种色调）","pronunciation":["띠ː다"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0